  unitName: Timeless Warden Zeruiah
  unitId: 830116
  unitNumber: 8173
  description: Zeruiah was one with the Vale. With the Fae rallied behind, the deity
    turned wildlife, plants and the very elements against the goblin invaders. Trees
    uprooted into towering treants that smashed the puny humanoids by the dozens.
    Stags and boars charged and impaled any greenskins that survived the onslaught
    of mighty Earth and Water elementals. In one fell swoop, the goblin swarm was
    defeated and routed out of the Vale. Drawing on her divine powers, Zeruiah erected
    wards and summoned raging blizzards that would keep out evil monsters. For countless
    millennia, the Vale flourished and expanded under the protection and rule of
    Zeruiah. The Fae channeled and constructed majestic Vaults in which they stored
    all sorts of treasures, tomes and artifacts collected or crafted over the ages.
    Knowledge of these Vaults gradually leaked to the world outside and many civilizations
    sought to gain entry into the Vale, fueled by greed and curiosity. From historical
    records, none made it in.
  summonDesc: I am the same yesterday and<br>today and tomorrow.. I will<br> protect
    you for eternity..
  fusionDesc: Who is this human girl?<br>My frozen and battle-weary heart<br>is being
    thawed by a strange warmth.
  evoDesc: As endless as the stars..<br>my knowledge shall kindle<br>the lives of
    my subjects.
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
